              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">A Chieftain has a Hand weapon, light armour, thrusting or throwing spear, javelins and shield. Warband. Stealth. May ride a horse (+11) or a warhorse (+18) or a chariot as from the list below (+64). In each of these cases he becomes Ld7 but is no longer Warband.

A standard bearer has a hand weapon, light armour and shield. Army Standard Bearer. Warband. Stealth. May ride a horse (+11) or a warhorse (+18) or a chariot as from the list below (+64). In each of these cases he becomes Ld7 but is no longer Warband.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
